  characterID: 7_1
  characterName: Playwright
  characterDescription: "A sobbing playwright who has lost her partner actor, before
    his death, he carved and gifted her 2 mannequins for his replacement. Driven
    by madness, she now wanders the land, dragging random people to find the perfect
    performer to die as the villain in her new grand act, and once it has done, only
    then will she fulfill her partner\u2019s greatest wish.\r\n\r\nShe fights with
    2 of her mannequins, standing by the sidelines, resilient to all forms of damage,
    for the writer must be the director of this performance to the death.\r\n\r\n"
  maxHealth: 10
